  "releaseNotes": "v2.3.0: Bug fixes for domain event parameter naming (EntityCreatedEvent,\n      EntityModifiedEvent,\n      EntityRestoredEvent). JsonExtensions options changed to static readonly fields for\n      System.Text.Json\n      caching. PagedResult converted to sealed record. New IHttpClientService abstraction.\n      ICacheService\n      extended with RemoveByPrefixAsync and GetStatisticsAsync. DataValidation completed with\n      IsValidEmail, IsValidUrl, IsValidPhoneNumber. SpResponse cleaned up (Payload deprecated,\n      IsSuccess simplified to Code == 0). Full XML documentation on all public members.\n      NoWarn 1591 suppression removed. Target framework: net10.0 only.",
